WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:06.380
<i>Today the Special Investigation Team of the Tokyo District Prosecutors Office raided Aiba Foundation</i>

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:08.590
<i>as it's being indicted for an enourmous tax evasion.</i>

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:14.220
<i>It's expected that CEO Ruri Aiba will coon be called in for questioning.</i>

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:15.800
We have no comment. There will be a formal announcement
after the board of directors meeting.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.850
Please forward the information from the London branch.

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:20.980
Yes, it's a trap.

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:24.150
Someone is trying to crush
the Aiba Foundation.

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:28.650
We're looking into multiple foreign funds
and what the Tax Bureau is doing.

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:32.280
It appears to be a deliberately prepared attack.

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:34.570
Regardless, these allegations are ridiculous--

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:35.700
Miss Ruri!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.580
One by one, our foreign accounts
are being frozen.

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:43.080
Do what is necessary to secure funds
to cover our employees!

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:47.290
Worst case, even if we lose the company,
at least everyone can maintain their lives.

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:48.710
Who are you?

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:53.470
Ruri Aiba, I have a warrant
for your arrest.

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:58.600
You're being charged with embezzling
Aiba Foundation funds for personal use.

00:02:32.650 --> 00:02:38.660
It's reported that Ruri Aiba, the director
of Aiba Academy, has just been arrested.

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:41.910
You've got to be kidding!

00:02:41.910 --> 00:02:44.910
Why are they saying such things
about the director?

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:48.790
Idiots, you dumb nuts!

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:52.880
Come on, calm down.

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:57.670
But, I'm so angry at what they're saying.

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:07.390
Ruri and Kagami have been
working so hard.

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:10.060
How did this happen?

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:12.770
Tandoji!

00:03:14.730 --> 00:03:16.690
I can't just sit here.

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:20.570
I'm not even sure
what I can do, but...

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:24.620
Wakana?

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:26.580
Come with me.

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:33.750
Ugh, my chest.

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:38.010
Wakana, I'm amazed you know
about this place.

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:39.920
OK then.

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:41.800
Oh, Kagami!

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:45.930
Oh my, that looks awesome on you!

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:47.390
Shhh!

00:03:48.890 --> 00:03:50.980
Where have you been?

00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:52.440
Tandoji!

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:57.570
I've been tied up, too.

00:03:58.280 --> 00:04:00.450
I can't disclose everything
to you here.

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:01.950
Come.

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:03.700
Wait!

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:07.580
If you see Ruri,
can you tell her this:

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:10.660
We all believe in her.

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:14.420
We'll be here waiting for her.

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:17.420
Got it!

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:21.590
But, um, if she doesn't get back here fast,
we're all going to be in trouble.

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:24.760
Yeah, if the stone club goes under,
we'll all be in trouble.

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:34.560
In the chaos of the house search,
they took away Miss Aoi.

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:37.770
On top of that, I can't get
anywhere near the estate.

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:39.320
What about the maids?

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:42.110
I've let all of them go.

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:43.490
What?

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:45.870
To minimize the damage.

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:47.950
If only I could...

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:49.080
You?!

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:50.540
You know this is huge!

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:52.660
You think you can do
something by yourself?

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:54.500
Keep your voice down!

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:56.960
What's wrong with you?

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:59.130
Nothing's wrong with me!

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:05.510
It's Kenmi's troops.

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:15.770
Oh, my...

00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:21.860
You've already woken up.

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:27.450
You would have been happier if you had
never come out of your slumber.

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:34.160
What is...

00:05:36.710 --> 00:05:41.800
Miss Ruri, do you know about
the human sacrifice rituals of the Aztec's?

00:05:48.390 --> 00:05:51.600
Dammit, let go. Let go!

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:53.060
Let me go!

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:55.730
We've captured the two targets.

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:58.810
High school girls panties, oni!

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:02.570
Oh, Oni-gawara!

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:04.780
Yo, I've come to help, oni!

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:17.750
Don't move!

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:19.210
Hands up!

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:26.880
You're the last of them.

00:06:27.510 --> 00:06:28.720
Lay your weapon down.

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:30.140
Hold up!

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:36.350
Hey! That was my chance
to be a hero, oni!

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:40.940
You guys...

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:42.730
It was quite a task.

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:45.820
When the cops weren't looking,
we hauled away all this stuff.

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:50.780
The Maid troops have gathered.

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:54.620
Preparation of the Engagement Suit is complete!

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:57.200
I thought I let you all go.

00:06:57.620 --> 00:06:59.960
You have no connection with Aiba.

00:07:00.170 --> 00:07:01.040
We know.

00:07:01.210 --> 00:07:05.130
We're doing this of our own free will.

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:05.920
But...

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:10.130
We're not part of Aiba, so we no longer need
to listen to what you say.

00:07:10.720 --> 00:07:14.140
We all want to help out Miss Ruri and you.

00:07:14.140 --> 00:07:17.730
We've made it this far.
Let us go through with this until the very end.

00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:19.980
You heard them.

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:28.990
You fools.

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:36.910
You are...

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:40.210
Naito left to finish things with Kenmi.

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:44.090
You're going  to save Ruri, right?

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:47.210
Please, take me with you!

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:55.140
Central America was united into
a great empire by the Aztecs.

00:07:55.510 --> 00:07:57.560
They continually waged wars,

00:07:57.640 --> 00:08:01.270
and gouged out living hearts from
the thousands of prisoners of war.

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:09.110
They knew.

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:16.280
Those warriors who were under the protection
of the Sun, or the beings from heaven.

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:19.830
Within their hearts held superior powers.

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:28.840
The "core" of the Sacred, that power
is the most proper gift to the gods!

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:35.970
In return, they received
the greatest power.

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:41.270
Hey.

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:43.100
What's all this nonsense?

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:46.230
Kenmi, what are you up to?

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:52.650
By acquiring your heart,
I'm going to join the gods.

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:57.620
No, no!

00:08:57.990 --> 00:09:00.080
Stop!

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:06.080
Help me, Alma!

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:12.970
Dr. Kenmi!

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:24.270
Kenmi has started his quest to gain
the power of the Sacred himself,

00:09:24.270 --> 00:09:26.400
by crushing Aiba Foundation.

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:28.650
What is his plan?

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:31.190
I can't tell for sure.

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:36.950
But he doesn't think
we're the same humans as he is.

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:40.700
If this goes on, Miss Ruri will...

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:49.130
It's convenient for us that
Naito Kijima is ahead of us.

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:52.760
Let's take advantage of this and
create as much commotion as possible.

00:09:52.760 --> 00:09:54.170
Yes sir!

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:55.670
Oni!

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:56.680
Oni!
Tandoji.

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:59.970
You're to save Miss Ruri
while they're panicking.

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:01.260
Gotcha.

00:10:01.850 --> 00:10:05.850
I think I can guide you
a bit in the facility.

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:08.440
Maybe even find Miss Ruri's
whereabouts.

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:10.400
We have no idea what
might happen in--

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:11.480
I know.

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:16.900
But, I want to save my brother.

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:25.410
Prepare the Cyclops.

00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:28.000
But we might obliterate
Ruri Aiba's entire body.

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:30.420
Then we would most likely
destroy the core as well.

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:35.510
It's not that fragile of a stone.

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:43.140
Even if her body is blasted to pieces,
there's no way the core will sustain even a scratch.

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:45.310
Get moving, hurry.

00:10:45.470 --> 00:10:46.810
Yes, sir.

00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:50.020
What?

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:10.040
We couldn't hold Naito back.

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:13.210
We've detected a freight trailer
at the lakeside.

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:19.880
They're moving just
like we anticipated.

00:11:20.550 --> 00:11:22.010
Off to work.

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:26.520
Also, release Number 0.

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:30.020
A good choice for the finishing touch.

00:11:50.920 --> 00:11:53.920
That Naito, he's gone crazy, oni!

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:57.460
If he continues as a Dark Stone,
he won't be able to turn back to normal, oni.

00:12:04.600 --> 00:12:06.600
Oni!

00:12:12.390 --> 00:12:13.810
Leave this one to me!

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:28.950
This way.

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:31.210
There's a shortcut.

00:12:32.670 --> 00:12:34.210
Be safe!

00:12:45.550 --> 00:12:46.470
Brother!

00:12:46.470 --> 00:12:47.640
Get back!

00:13:07.740 --> 00:13:10.160
This... This is...

00:13:25.340 --> 00:13:28.220
Why does he have my mother's pendant?

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:30.060
What are you doing?

00:13:31.430 --> 00:13:33.560
You're in the way, get lost!

00:13:38.190 --> 00:13:40.940
Hung Yuk, I will release you!

00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:43.360
Naito, stop!

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:50.700
Why did you come?

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:52.200
My brother.

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:53.500
You have to let it go.

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:56.080
Hung can't go back
to being a human.

00:13:56.330 --> 00:13:59.170
We need to put him to rest,
before he gets used by Kenmi.

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:00.670
I brought the serum!

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:03.670
Use this to help my brother!

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:06.220
Please, Naito!

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:20.230
No, let me go! No!

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:23.480
Hands off!

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:26.780
Hands off of Fei!

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:42.630
Hung...

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:49.180
We only have one chance to do this.

00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:49.800
Right.

00:14:58.640 --> 00:15:00.690
Oni!

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:06.820
This sensation... I feel so uneasy.

00:15:06.820 --> 00:15:09.490
Please, be safe!

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:20.420
Ruri!

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:25.500
What!

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:28.130
No, it can't be!

00:15:29.630 --> 00:15:35.140
Ruri!

00:15:46.650 --> 00:15:47.820
Well, well.

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:50.530
Her protective response
just doesn't stop.

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:55.370
If this goes on, your beloved Ruri
won't come back.

00:15:56.490 --> 00:15:57.490
No!

00:15:57.620 --> 00:15:59.830
Ruri, please come back!

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:06.630
Please!

00:16:07.550 --> 00:16:09.840
Hear me!

00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:17.220
My soul!

00:16:19.850 --> 00:16:22.440
Take it!

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:36.450
How pretty!

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:38.700
There's some more!

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:46.380
This pendant was cut out from
a raw stone of the Sacred Seven.

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:48.880
It suppresses its powers.

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:55.970
I can only hope that this will bring
some peace to our children's future.

00:17:00.470 --> 00:17:01.560
Watch out!

00:17:21.250 --> 00:17:22.290
That's right...

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:27.630
That was the first time we met.

00:17:34.970 --> 00:17:36.760
How could I have forgotten...

00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:40.430
...such an important thing?

00:17:41.970 --> 00:17:42.930
I'm sorry...

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:45.310
...Ruri.

00:17:51.480 --> 00:17:53.030
Alma?

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:57.570
This can't be!

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:03.910
It's my fault.

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:06.670
I can finally return the favor.

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:14.760
When we started, you let me use up
the memento from your mother.

00:18:14.970 --> 00:18:16.970
It's all good now.

00:18:17.430 --> 00:18:18.390
But...

00:18:19.430 --> 00:18:22.600
I have no need for the pendant anymore.

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:26.600
Because you're here.

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:29.400
I get it, I see.

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:36.530
The two of you foster a power
much greater than what I expected.

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:38.740
Wonderful!

00:18:44.790 --> 00:18:46.580
Fei, now's your chance.

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:47.660
Right!

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:52.960
Please, brother Hung!

00:18:56.090 --> 00:19:00.590
I was right to hold such high expectations
for you, Alma Tandoji.

00:19:01.510 --> 00:19:04.510
Three years ago, when you
first became a Dark Stone...

00:19:05.680 --> 00:19:10.650
When the limiter was taken away from you,
you showed such strength.

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:17.440
But after that, you didn't try
to use your powers.

00:19:17.530 --> 00:19:20.910
Even though we hid the limiter
away from you,

00:19:21.030 --> 00:19:25.040
you kept the power of the Sacred
in check on your own.

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:28.910
That's why I created
all these different situations.

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:32.380
So that you could go as berserk
as you could get.

00:19:33.460 --> 00:19:35.960
Ah, the beauty in the power
of the Sacred.

00:19:35.960 --> 00:19:39.800
To heighten the degree of its purity
to the limit!

00:19:43.050 --> 00:19:44.050
No, that can't be.

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:47.430
All the incidents that I've encountered,
you created?

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:51.560
That's right, all by me.

00:19:56.860 --> 00:19:57.980
Brother?

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:15.040
Hands off!

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:18.920
Brother!

00:20:20.470 --> 00:20:22.510
Hands off!

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:30.640
So...

00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:34.940
Let me take that power
you've been develop--

00:20:39.860 --> 00:20:40.650
What?

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:43.990
Hung Yuk?

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:48.740
<i>Hands off... !</i>

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:50.870
<i>... of Fei!</i>

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:52.870
Hands off!

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:56.290
Hands off, hands off!

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:12.480
Hung!

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:14.060
Brother!

00:21:21.490 --> 00:21:22.690
Brother...

00:21:24.070 --> 00:21:25.700
Brother Hung!

00:21:27.570 --> 00:21:29.580
Hello, you trash.

00:21:29.910 --> 00:21:33.830
Your brother left a great gift.

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:35.920
For me!

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:43.050
Oh, you beautiful thing!

00:21:44.220 --> 00:21:49.180
With this, I too can join the gods!

00:21:53.180 --> 00:21:57.270
Oh, the wonder!

00:22:06.030 --> 00:22:07.860
I can't believe it!

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:15.710
My whole body, every muscle is shaking with joy.

00:22:17.290 --> 00:22:18.880
Invincible...

00:22:19.250 --> 00:22:22.880
I can taste invincibility!
